# "aah choir" (chord track, two singers per voice, spread in stereo): a four-note chord, then a five-note chord
# that steals voices (host fade, stage 5), then "ooh choir" with the vowel opening while the chord holds.
tempo 90
steps 24
tail 4.0
track chord
preset 109 140 110 150 230 120 0 0 128 0 128 165 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C3 8 100
note 0 G3 8 100
note 0 C4 8 100
note 0 E4 8 100
note 8 A2 8 110
note 8 E3 8 110
note 8 A3 8 110
note 8 C4 8 110
note 8 E4 8 110
param p1 40 16
sweep p1 40 120 16 24
note 16 F3 8 90
note 16 A3 8 90
note 16 C4 8 90
note 16 F4 8 90
expect sound 0 24
expect idle 70
expect peak_below -3
